#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-deset-mapping-boat.rst:10
#: 9cc37a7049be40f09ed5d82ecdb5198d
msgid "The DeSET mapping boat is a relatively small but agile electric mapping boat designed by `JapanDrones <http://japandrones.com/>`__ and `AttracLab <http://attraclab.com/>`__ with input from `Shimane University <https://www.shimane-u.ac.jp/en/>`__ and `Lighthouse <https://isana.lighthouse-frontier.tech/>`__.  The development of this boat was sponsored by `DeSET <https://deset-en.lne.st/>`__"
msgstr ""

